      {
        "id": "tb-train-augmentation",
        "moduleId": "data-preparation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：训练与测试的图像变换",
        "markdown": "训练阶段的 `transform_train` 依次做：`RandomResizedCrop(224, scale=(0.08, 1.0), ratio=(3/4, 4/3))`，随机裁剪出原始面积 0.08 到 1 倍、宽高比在 3/4 到 4/3 之间的区域并缩放到 224×224；`RandomHorizontalFlip()` 随机水平翻转；`ColorJitter(brightness=0.4, contrast=0.4, saturation=0.4)` 随机改变亮度、对比度和饱和度；`ToTensor()`；最后用 ImageNet 三通道均值 `[0.485, 0.456, 0.406]` 和标准差 `[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]` 做 `Normalize`。测试阶段只使用确定性操作：`Resize(256)`、`CenterCrop(224)`、`ToTensor()`，以及同一组 `Normalize`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
